# Scoped Trivy allowlist for the blocking image scans in container-check.yml
# and release-image.yml under .github/workflows/.
#
# Blocking scans cover OS/application dependencies. The native connector scan
# skips only the SHA-pinned local Supercronic binary (HTTP/TLS paths unused;
# Sentry unset). An advisory scan still reports all findings, matching IBKR.
#
# Add an entry below only for a genuine, case-by-case suppression in a package we
# DO control (base image / Python). Each entry needs a reason and a re-review date.
# (Currently none.)
